## Sub-phase 4A B1: hand-written future from std.time must
## typecheck end-to-end — class registration + Future mixin +
## Output = nil + def var poll + def init + def drop.
##
## Constructs a TimeSleepFuture but never polls it; the surface
## check here is enough to assert the bootstrap pass-2 pickup
## (task #14 fix, commit b74546d) is wired through. The runtime
## path is covered by the e2e fixture 725_time_sleep_block_on.rx.

use std.time.Duration

def main
  let _f = Async.sleep(Duration.from_millis(10))
  puts "compiled"
end
